title: Together for the Congreso?
subtitle: ERC and JxCat must decide whether to extend their coalition to the Spanish election
view-if: player_party == "erc" and jxcat_formed and erc_in_jxcat and not jxcat_in_congreso and next_spanish_election_time - time <= 6 and next_spanish_election_time - time >= 3
tags: event
new-page: true
max-visits: 1

= Together for the Congreso?

Our alliance with JxCat was formed for the Parlament, but the upcoming Spanish election presents a separate choice. Running together would offer voters a single pro-independence candidacy in Catalonia and a united delegation in Madrid; running separately would preserve ERC's own voice.

- @together: Extend the JxCat coalition to the Congreso
- @separate: Run as ERC in the Congreso

@together
on-arrival: {!
    var carriers = ["ciu", "cdc", "dl", "pdcat", "junts"];
    var support = Q.jxcat_congreso_catalunya_support || 0;
    for (var carrier of carriers) {
        var key = carrier + "_congreso_catalunya_support";
        support += Q[key] || 0;
        Q[key] = 0;
    }
    support += Q.erc_congreso_catalunya_support || 0;
    Q.erc_congreso_catalunya_support = 0;
    Q.jxcat_congreso_catalunya_support = support;
    Q.jxcat_in_congreso = true;
!}

ERC and JxCat will contest the Congreso election together, combining their support behind the JxCat ballot.

- @post_event: We will present a united delegation

@separate

ERC and JxCat will contest the Congreso election separately.

- @post_event: Each party will defend its own programme
